    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "That ain't your religion, you just followin' your mammy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "She followed your granny, she obeyed master",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Did y'all even ask up questions?",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "It's holes in them stories",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Is it holes in your blessings?",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Yeah, I'm bold with the message",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I know I ain't got the answer",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But I ain't gon' cheerlead with y'all just to be a dancer",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I'ma groove to my own drums, sunlight in my shadow, baby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Move 'til my soul cums, let them serpents rattle, baby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCADEBFAA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCAADBEAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I came a long way from my past, nigga, it's obvious",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "V12 engine, I'm fishtailin' on some sloppy shit (Skrrt)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Internet bringin' old lyrics up, like I hide the shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "What's your address, I could probably send you a copy, bitch",
          "rhyme": "itS",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I was canceled before canceled was with Twitter fingers (Haha)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Protestin' outside my shows, I gave them the middle finger (Fuck 'em)",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I was a teener, tweetin' Selena crazy shit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Didn't wanna offend her, apologize when I seen her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Back when I was tryna fuck Bieber, Justin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I say with my chest out, you say with your chest in, nigga (Say it with your chest, nigga)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Black bodies hanging from trees, I cannot make sense of this (Uh)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Hit some protest and retweeted positive messages (Uh)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Donated some funds then I went and copped me a necklace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'm probably a coon to your standards based on this evidence",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Am I doin' enough or not doin' enough?",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I'm tryna run with the baton, but see, my shoes in the mud",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I feel like anything I say, dog, I'm screwin' shit up (Sorry)",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "So I just tell these Black babies they should do what they want",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Freedom, need 'em, my niggas, seen 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Free 'em, don't fuck with the law like, damn, Gina",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "So calm the fuck down before we duck rounds",
          "rhyme": "und",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And fireballs that make your family have to duck the fuck down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "We frontline, we got the mazel tov that we can chuck now (Woo)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "'Cause anytime we movin' up, it's like a \"What the fuck now?\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "They playin' games, we strappin' up, we cock and aim (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "We aim to shoot, we shoot to claim what we need",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "We done with pain and the grievin', niggas is done with the peace",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Whether it's personal or for the whole of niggas, indeed (Yah)",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "I might not have dreadlocks, I might have these gold teeth",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "But I'm a nigga like you, and you's a nigga like me (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "So let's be niggas together, and let's be niggas with plans",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "But put this plastic on first, 'cause shit is hittin' the fan, Scott",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBCDDBDEFGHIJKLMNOFPQLLERIRSTNU",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABBBCCBCDEBEEFGHIFJEAEHHDBEBJKFG"
    },
    {
